                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2c91b893-3acf-4602-a861-5672535663b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "eee471fb-9742-3b52-8f7e-a2efdc956242",
                        "source_sense_id": "5a260c97-90a7-36e4-9e42-3b9e61627d37",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gefäß mit Henkel und Tülle, in dem Soßen serviert werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "gravy boat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gravy boat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9fa4be2-f8ce-3ab7-90d4-426f4f96ae5b",
                                        "entry_id": "18aa97a4-2aaa-37e3-8fe8-b595279a84ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dish with a handle and spout, used to serve gravy or other sauces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c16821f0-c8b4-3755-b215-d7273bfc1480",
                                        "entry_id": "18aa97a4-2aaa-37e3-8fe8-b595279a84ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A source of easily obtained money or benefits."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a71ac100-06ad-44e2-9481-fdd0e2276044",
                                                "sense_id": "c16821f0-c8b4-3755-b215-d7273bfc1480",
                                                "text": "Not only have suggestions for their elimination evoked a great hue and cry of protest, but other pressure groups are plugging diligently in an effort to get aboard the \"gravy boat.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5e3cef1-72bd-4b26-bfa3-26e1c4ca8c5e",
                                                "sense_id": "c16821f0-c8b4-3755-b215-d7273bfc1480",
                                                "text": "Everybody had climbed aboard the \"gravy boat”—except the landlord; and he wanted to get in, too."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "533faedc-8f4e-4eea-93e7-8d56bea292e2",
                                                "sense_id": "c16821f0-c8b4-3755-b215-d7273bfc1480",
                                                "text": "Through drawing attention to that, many organisations which had never previously put in an application for assistance had tried to get on the gravy boat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f857643d-4a16-46b8-ae08-605bb62a072f",
                                                "sense_id": "c16821f0-c8b4-3755-b215-d7273bfc1480",
                                                "text": "This herd behavior in not wanting to miss the gravy boat led to a collective lowering of standards that ended with the 2008 financial implosion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e14e774e-ad2b-43b3-a76f-b45221274b46",
                        "source_entry_id": "eee471fb-9742-3b52-8f7e-a2efdc956242",
                        "source_sense_id": "5a260c97-90a7-36e4-9e42-3b9e61627d37",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gefäß mit Henkel und Tülle, in dem Soßen serviert werden",
